  "steps": [
    "Heat the oven to 200 °C. Cut a lid off the pumpkin and scoop out the seeds.",
    "Put the sliced onion in the pumpkin with a little oil, salt and pepper. Set the Camembert on top, score it lightly and add chilli flakes, thyme, salt and pepper. Put the lid back on.",
    "Toss the potatoes (halve the big ones) with oil, paprika, garlic powder, dried herbs, salt and pepper on a large tray.",
    "Cut the top off the garlic head, drizzle with oil and put it on the tray with the pumpkin, potatoes around it. Roast 50–60 minutes until everything is tender.",
    "Squeeze the roasted garlic into the melted Camembert and stir it in with the onion.",
    "Drizzle with honey, finish with thyme and chilli flakes and serve with the potatoes for dipping."
  ],
